integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] {{Style, framing, identity, costume, positions, environment and light}}. {{Actions, camera movement and reactions in playback order}}. {{Speaker}} (S1) says, <d>[English] {{Exact dialogue; delete the entire speaking sentence if absent}}</d>. {{Final state; add [Shot 2] At MM:SS.mmm only for a required cut within the actual duration}}.

